ary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너는","audio":"/audio/54abca9caefe5ae47b8e.mp3"}},{"text":"학생이","meaning":"学生","explanation":"학생：学生；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"학생","audio":"/audio/f24650b42089c29f9027.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31670","senseId":"1","lemma":"학생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"학생이","audio":"/audio/6186fc8f724b430f2130.mp3"}},{"text":"공책","meaning":"笔记本","explanation":"공책：笔记本","readings":[{"term":"공책","audio":"/audio/06bbecd00d0929ecc83f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15252","senseId":"1","lemma":"공책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공책","audio":"/audio/06bbecd00d0929ecc83f.mp3"}},{"text":"한","meaning":"一","explanation":"한：一","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"1","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}},{"text":"권도","meaning":"本","explanation":"권：本；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"권","audio":"/audio/5e113c9ef13b571371a0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62537","senseId":"1","lemma":"권","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"권도","audio":"/audio/e48014dae51f28f00b75.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"가지고","meaning":"持，带，戴","explanation":"가지다：持，带，戴；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"가지다","audio":"/audio/f3b684d86e5485ededb3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65234","senseId":"1","lemma":"가지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가지고","audio":"/audio/2e847f33430d128ed48a.mp3"}},{"text":"다니니?","meaning":"上班，上学，上","explanation":"다니다：上班，上学，上；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"